      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "InstantRepost API",
      "Anchor": "instantrepost-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "DMA InstantRepost API returns reposts of a post. These are reshares without commentary \u2014 for reshares with commentary, see the DMA Post API. DMA InstantRepost API only supports BATCH_GET.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "InstantRepost API",
      "Anchor": "instantrepost-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service currently provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "InstantRepost API",
      "Anchor": "instantrepost-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "BATCH_GET - List of DMA instantReposts for the given set of ids (instantRepostUrn)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
