          },
          {
            "Text": "Retrieve reposts by your organization, reposts of your organization\u0027s posts, or reposts of reshares with commentary of your organization\u0027s posts. Restricted to organizations in which the authenticated member has one of the following company page roles. ADMINISTRATORCONTENT_ADMINISTRATOR",
