      "Section": "Access",
      "Anchor": "access",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Access"
      ],
      "Text": "An organizational admin can access an instantRepost through this API if one of the following is true:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Access",
      "Anchor": "access",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Access"
      ],
      "Text": "That organization/organizationalPage created the original post that was reposted.\nThat organization/organizationalPage created the instantRepost",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Access",
      "Anchor": "access",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Access"
      ],
      "Text": "If a non-authorized viewer tries to access reposts, the API will throw 403.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "InstantRepost URNs",
      "Anchor": "instantrepost-urns",
      "SectionPath": [
        "InstantRepost URNs"
      ],
      "Text": "An instantRepost URN is a composite URN constructed using the ID of the instantRepost and the original post URN (shareUrn, ugcPostUrn) which is reposted. For example, an instantRepost on urn:li:share:7067167295080394752 would look like - urn:li:instantRepost:(urn:li:share:7067167295080394752,1234).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
